{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S02、S04、S06等段的感受意象有近义重复，水波、光影、漂浮等比喻有时堆得过密，快速扫读时容易分散注意力；Y在这方面更利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息密度更高，但重点句中的放大加亮能让人迅速抓住人物当下的心理变化，感受又能随音乐分时出现，不必一次读完所有内容。更重要的是，X保留了人物从怕给对方负担、害怕失去亲近，到意识到彼此需要、愿意坦然表达，再到接受未来不确定性的细微心理转变，尤其S06、S11、S13比Y交代得更完整。Y确实更容易扫读，但部分心理动机和情绪层次被压缩，整体故事仍通顺，却少了一些值得边听边体会的细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b82c2f60-98f4-4da8-9f6f-9ca89b2cb61f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T230243451526Z", "elapsed_seconds": 110.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:04:33.602588+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4e2a31a58d235cf07c10ce25a82ee312d85c3b6504cb5db8f19fbf460ed02b42", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa3